<title>UK: Great Western Resources gets 23p/shr offer.</title>
<headline>Great Western Resources gets 23p/shr offer.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Great Western Resources Inc said on Tuesday it received a conditional offer to buy the company at about 23p per share cash.</p>
<p>The company's statement did not say whether it planned to accept the offer.</p>
<p>It added that it would make a further announcement as soon as possible, and in any event by December 20. The firm's shares were marked up 5.0p at 20.5 by 1350 GMT.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
